abstract: >-
  Working theoretical models of functional gamete persistence, finite egg
  availability and the joint evolution of acceptance and postmating restraint.
  Includes earlier model versions and a proposed, unimplemented extension
  to secondary contact and reinforcement. Numerical values are illustrative.
